# Boss EXP in a scripted boss fight (Red Dragon, battle id 8). Run with --save.
# The Red Dragon Cave's script (017) starts the fight with script op 0x10 type 3, battle id 8 (0x1604).
# Like boss_sasquatch.plan, this plan stands Jian in Delrich Temple (map 6) and does the field loop's
# three writes itself (0x020B7838 = 1, 0x020B783A = battle id, 0x020B0010 = 0x73). The dragon has no
# area_min override, so the fight keeps map 6's area_min (4) and at party level 1 it rolls level 4 here.
# Expected (docs/boss-exp.md): row 147, EXP 79 at level 0 and 13557 at level 98: 79 + 13478 * 4 / 98 = 629.
# (In its own cave the fight rolls level 23 or more: 3242.)
# 40 A presses, then a shot and an A every 120 frames walk the rest of the fight and the result pages.
watch u16 0x020B85BE event_battle_id
watch u16 0x020B85C0 battle_mode
watch u16 0x020B85C8 result_sub
watch u32 0x020B8610 exp_pool
watch u32 0x020B4824 silver
watch u32 0x020B4694 jian_exp32
watch u32 0x020B4664 jian_level
include boot_from_save
include cheats_strong
# warp6 without the final move onto an enemy spawn point
pin u16 0x020B77EC 6
press Right 40
press Down,Right 40
press Right 40
press Down 80
wait 200
unpin
wait 30
shot reddragon_field
peek u32 0x020B4694 jian_exp_before
peek u32 0x020B4664 jian_level_before
peek u32 0x020B4824 silver_before
poke u16 0x020B7838 1
poke u16 0x020B783A 8
poke u32 0x020B0010 0x73
wait 240
shot reddragon_intro
battlers
peek u32 0x020B85B8 area_group
peek u16 0x020B85BC map
peek u32 0x020B8620 stats_ptr
# battle stat records 0..13 (0x6C each): +0x0C level, +0x14 HP, +0x50 EXP the kill adds
dump 0x0228E860 0x5E8 stat_records
press A 3
wait 40
press A 3
wait 40
press A 3
wait 40
press A 3
wait 40
press A 3
wait 40
shot reddragon_a5
battlers
